# Validation expectations

After substantive implementation:

1. `npm run openapi:lint` when APIs change.
2. `npm run test:e2e` when UI/HTTP behavior changes (or document skip reason).
3. `TRUECOURSE_TELEMETRY=0 npx truecourse analyze --diff` before merge if TrueCourse is enabled.
4. Regenerate structural intel when module graph shifts: `npm run intel:graphs` and/or `npm run intel:gitnexus`.

Do not mark work complete with only “compiles locally”.
